# temp audit bucket objectLock=Enabled (segment 1..5 replicated)
# truncate below replicated boundary (7->4, seg covers 1..5): verify.ok=false brokenAt=5 => DETECTED via remote segment
# object-lock-enabled bucket, object PUT without retention, root delete -> DELETED (S3Objects.put sets no ObjectLockRetainUntilDate)

# policy user DeleteObject on AUDIT bucket (nonexistent key) -> Error  (expect AccessDenied = cannot delete audit)
# policy user DeleteObject on DOWNLOAD bucket (nonexistent key) -> Error  (expect success/NoSuchKey = delete allowed for cleanup)
# policy user DELETE audit/nonexistent -> AccessDenied http=403 (cannot delete audit)
# policy user DELETE download/nonexistent -> SUCCESS (delete allowed for cleanup)
